# Product Requirements Document (PRD)

Project: SalesPilot

Version: 1.0

Status: Approved

---

# Purpose

This document defines every functional requirement of SalesPilot.

It acts as the single source of truth for product behavior.

All implementation decisions should reference this document before code is written.

When implementation and this document disagree, this document takes precedence.

---

# Product Summary

SalesPilot is a Lead Management SaaS that enables organizations to:

- Capture leads
- Organize leads
- Assign leads
- Track lead progress
- Collaborate through notes and activities
- Build multiple public forms
- Manage sales teams

The application focuses on simplicity, speed and maintainability.

It is **not** intended to become a complete CRM platform.

---

# Product Goals

The product should help organizations:

• Capture leads quickly

• Reduce manual lead assignment

• Track the complete lifecycle of every lead

• Prevent lost leads

• Detect duplicates

• Organize sales teams

• Provide accountability through activity history

