# User Roles

SalesPilot supports four roles.

## Owner

Highest privilege.

Responsibilities

- Manage organization
- Invite members
- Manage branding
- Manage forms
- Manage settings
- Remove any member
- Access every lead

Exactly one Owner exists per organization.

Future architecture supports ownership transfer.

Current implementation does not.

---

## Admin

Administrative role.

Can

- Invite users
- Remove Managers
- Remove Members
- Create forms
- Manage leads
- Configure branding
- Configure custom fields

Cannot

- Remove Owner

---

## Manager

Responsible for a sales team.

Can

- View team leads
- Assign leads to members
- Update leads
- Merge duplicates
- View dashboard
- Create notes

Cannot

- Remove Admin
- Access organization settings

---

## Member

Lowest role.

Can

- View assigned leads
- Update assigned leads
- Add notes
- Upload attachments

Cannot

- Invite users
- Assign leads outside themselves
- Manage forms
- Manage organization

