# Account Linking

If an existing password account attempts Google login:

1. Detect existing account.

2. Ask for password.

3. Verify password.

4. Link Google account.

5. Create session.

Never automatically link accounts.

---

# Organizations

Every user belongs to organizations through OrganizationMembership.

Current product exposes one seeded organization.

Architecture supports multiple organizations.

No organization switching UI exists.

---

